# Regular -o/-oj noun morphology; the plural is used for any count != 1
# ("tri sekundoj" -- three seconds), Esperanto having no numeral-governed
# noun-form rule (contrast the Baltic/Slavic families).  Stem per PIV
# headword pattern, en.wiktionary.org "sekundo".  "sekundon" is the
# singular accusative the "ĉiun UNITn" recurrence periphrasis takes.
sekundo
sekundoj
sekundon
